-- VERIFIED: AI via AITraining.jobs page as of 4 Nov 2026; DSSSB via FreeJobAlert summary of DSSSB Advt No. 04/2026 (30 Sep 2026); HPRCA via FreeJobAlert summary of HPRCA Advt No. 14/2026 (2 Nov 2026).
